(SEQ ID NO: 993) Ac-[(D)Arg]-[Abu]-QTWQC-[Phe[4-(2-aminoethoxy)]]-[2-Nal]-[4-amino-4-carboxy-tetrahydropyran]-ENN-NH2;

(SEQ ID NO: 1043) Ac-[Abu]-QTWQC-[Phe[4-(2-aminoethoxy)]]-[2-Nal]-[acpc]-ENN-NH2;

